            %img{:alt => "Azcarraga", :src => "http://www.abc.es/Media/201405/19/jose-adolfo-azcarraga--644x362.jpg", :width => "290"}/
          %p
            José Adolfo de Azcárraga is full university professor of Theoretical Physics, IFIC member and emeritus professor at the University of Valencia, and president of the Spanish Royal Society of Physics (RSEF) (
            %a{:href => "http://www.uv.es/uvweb/college/en/news-release/-emeritus-professor-university-valencia-jose-adolfo-de-azcarraga-takes-responsabilityas-new-president-royal-spanish-society-physics-1285846070123/Noticia.html?id=1285890922554"}> web
            )
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://www.uv.es/~azcarrag/CV%20%20summary.pdf"} cv pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://sites.google.com/a/azcarraga.es/j-a-de-azcarraga/"} personal webpage
